'THE AMASTATIN INHIBITOR, (2S,3R)3-AMINO-2-HYDROXYL-5-METHYL, -HEXANOYL-L-VAL-L-VAL-L-ASP, IS PRESENTED IN THIS ENTRY AS CHAIN I' 
